---
// Shared site footer — used by the dashboard and every article page.
const link = "underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink";
---

<footer class="border-t border-rule py-10 text-xs leading-relaxed text-faint">
  <p>
    The estimates on this site depend on the assumptions in each scenario. Data comes from
    EIA reports, the IEA Oil Market Report, GEF, PortWatch/Kpler, CENTCOM statements, and news
    sources recorded in the daily research notes. Unverified reports stay in those notes
    until they can be checked. Hollow dots on the charts indicate a source's rounded estimate.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
    <a class={link} href="/">Dashboard</a>
    <a class={link} href="/model">Model</a>
  </p>
  <!-- The Astro compiler strips whitespace between text and tag boundaries, so spaces around the links below are written inline, not on separate lines. -->
  <p class="mt-3">© 2026. A <a class={link} href="https://www.mattcone.com">Matt Cone</a> project. <a class={link} rel="license" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Made with 🌶️ in <a class={link} href="https://www.newmexico.org/">New Mexico</a>. Built with help from a local AI (Qwen 3.8-27b) running on an HP Omen 30L (RTX 3090) in my office.</p>
